{"id":"doc:docs/knowledge-crib-deep-extraction.md#5-the-example-fully-represented","kind":"doc-section","file":"docs/knowledge-crib-deep-extraction.md","heading":"5. The example, fully represented","level":2,"anchor":"5-the-example-fully-represented","span":{"start":84,"end":100},"lang":"markdown","hash":"blake3:07d73d02a464614477e0dfb2a2a8e21fe1f56717a07e4e7d0083603eee2c4add","meta":{"codeRefs":["sql\nPROCEDURE process_claim(p_id) IS v_amt NUMBER;\nBEGIN\n  SELECT amount INTO v_amt FROM claims WHERE id=p_id;     -- stmt → reads CLAIMS.amount\n  IF v_amt > 10000 THEN escalate_claim(p_id);             -- calls {cfgPath:[\"v_amt>10000\"]}\n  ELSE                  auto_approve(p_id);                -- calls {cfgPath:[\"NOT(v_amt>10000)\"]}\n  END IF;\nEND;\n-- escalate_claim → notify_manager, hold_funds, log_audit, create_review  (cfgPath inherits)","returns the whole tree; each downstream call carries its **inherited\ncfgPath** (e.g.","is reachable only when","PROCEDURE","process_claim","p_id","IS","v_amt","NUMBER","BEGIN","SELECT","amount","INTO","FROM","claims","WHERE","id","stmt","reads","CLAIMS.amount","IF","10000","THEN","escalate_claim","calls","cfgPath","ELSE","auto_approve","NOT","END","notify_manager","hold_funds","log_audit","create_review","inherits"],"links":[]}}
